; bal -V and -X with --unrealized keep the revaluation between postings for
; a journal with a payee-rewrite directive, and print what they printed
; before the balance report valued postings at cost.  rewrite_posts copies
; every posting of a transaction whose payee it rewrites into a transaction
; of its own, dated by the posting, so the Brokerage posting, dated
; 2024/01/15, no longer shares its transaction's date, 2024/01/01, with the
; Checking posting.  A baseline that valued each cost on the date of its
; transaction converted the $1500 at EUR 0.80 on one side and at EUR 0.90
; on the other, and the -X EUR report printed Equity:Unrealized Gains
; EUR-310.00 and a total of EUR-150.00, while bal -G -X EUR reports a gain
; of EUR160.00.  Under -V the report books no unrealized gain and totals
; $200, as it did before.  The journal is that of
; unrealized-footing-posting-date.test with the directive added;
; unrealized-account-rewrite.test covers account-rewrite.

payee-rewrite Buy  Purchase

P 2024/01/01 $ 0.90 EUR
P 2024/01/10 $ 0.80 EUR

2024/01/01 Buy
    Assets:Brokerage        10 AAPL @ $150  ; [2024/01/15]
    Assets:Checking

P 2024/03/05 AAPL $170

test bal -X EUR --unrealized
           EUR160.00  Assets
          EUR1360.00    Brokerage
         EUR-1200.00    Checking
          EUR-150.00  Equity:Unrealized Gains
--------------------
            EUR10.00
end test

test bal -V --unrealized
                $200  Assets
               $1700    Brokerage
              $-1500    Checking
--------------------
                $200
end test

test bal -G -X EUR
           EUR160.00  Assets:Brokerage
end test
